1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,780
Clean the house. And take the meat
for tomorrow out of the fridge.

2
00:00:04,130 --> 00:00:05,680
Okay, Mom!

3
00:00:06,383 --> 00:00:09,563
But we were completely lost in our
movie.

4
00:00:10,383 --> 00:00:13,143
Kids, are you done? We're close.

5
00:00:13,493 --> 00:00:15,513
Yes, Mom! We're finishing!

6
00:00:16,383 --> 00:00:21,446
That's when we suddenly jumped up.
Cleaning, running, everything at

7
00:00:21,446 --> 00:00:21,823
once!

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:25,749
What happened to you two? We came
back from the gym and we're not

9
00:00:25,749 --> 00:00:26,290
even tired!

10
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:31,760
Wednesday again! How is it going
to be without meat?

11
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,280
You'll wipe the plate clean
anyway!

12
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:37,600
Well, how could I ever give up
your mother's cooking!

13
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:45,350
Time passed. We grew up. Each of
us began to lead our own life.

14
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:51,386
The family was still one, but we
could no longer meet the way we

15
00:00:51,386 --> 00:00:51,990
used to.

16
00:00:52,717 --> 00:00:55,637
We still gather sometimes.

17
00:00:57,717 --> 00:01:03,515
But one is on the phone, another
at work, another in a meeting...

18
00:01:03,515 --> 00:01:06,637
all of us busy with our own
things.

19
00:01:07,717 --> 00:01:13,189
We sit around one table. But our
thoughts are all in different

20
00:01:13,189 --> 00:01:13,807
places.

21
00:01:14,717 --> 00:01:20,920
Sometimes I miss the old laughter.
Those days when we were

22
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:22,097
together...

23
00:01:23,297 --> 00:01:25,727
Now... are we really together?
